An arc of the circle of radius 3 between two of its points that are farthest \
apart, on the square grid and on the square mesh:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e5bc1bf0-12fc-4a93-9fdc-14c3fb454a89"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"GraphicsRow", " ", "@", " ", 
